600 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 103 0 R/E(Jocelyn from JOCES is exceptional. She assisted greatly with a very complex council stormwater issue I had with the council. Her professionalism and thorough understanding of all elements surrounding the stormwater issue was a breath of fresh air. I spoke with countless engineers over the last two years, which made the problems seem unresolvable, though Jocelyn understood them quickly and simplified the process greatly. I recommend JOCES for anything stormwater related.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

601 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 103 0 R/E(One of our residential development projects recently encountered a major challenge that required a more detailed flood report to progress. We engaged Jocelyn Do and her firm, JOCES, and it has made all the difference.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

602 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 103 0 R/E(Jocelyn's expertise, keen attention to detail, and proactive communication helped us navigate a complex situation with confidence. Thanks to the team at Joces, we were able to overcome a significant setback and get this project back on track. )/Pg 37 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

603 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 103 0 R/E(We highly recommend Jocelyn and her team at Joces to anyone needing expert support with flood risk assessment and stormwater design.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[13]>>
