608 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 104 0 R/E(Wingecarribee Shire Council has engaged the services of JOCES to undertake development engineering services. We have worked with Ms Do for the past 2 years and during this time found Ms Do to be highly professional and diligent in her advice on civil road and drainage engineering projects.)/Pg 38 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

609 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 104 0 R/E(Over the past year, we've worked with JOCES on a range of complex development applications and construction certificates, including large-scale subdivisions, commercial supermarket developments and a high volume of infill developments. Their support in stormwater and road infrastructure assessments has been consistently high quality, helping guide key Council decisions. JOCES\220 proactive and clear communication, has helped us manage technical challenges, set priorities, and meet deadlines confidently and ultimately, more timely planning outcomes for the community.)/Pg 38 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

610 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 104 0 R/E(Their approach is practical, thorough, and collaborative, aligning strongly with their values of Excellence and Communication. They\220ve played a key role in improving our internal workflows and turnaround times, leading to more efficient planning outcomes. We see great value in the partnership and would confidently recommend JOCES to other Councils or developers seeking a reliable, engaged, and technically strong engineering consultancy. Continued documentation refinement and clarity on design assumptions would add even more value, but overall, JOCES has proven to be a trusted and professional asset to our team.)/Pg 38 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

